
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# rails_output_and_stubs.co
#
# Two sections:
#  1. Input-rail stubs for topic_control_check and pii_pattern_check.
#     Referenced in config.yml but not yet implemented elsewhere; these are
#     pass-through flows so NeMo loads without errors.  Replace the body with
#     real logic when needed.
#
#  2. Output-rail flows.  These are NOT called from the Python layer yet
#     (chat.py only invokes check_message_guardrails for input).  They are
#     defined here so config.yml references are satisfied and NeMo loads.
#     Wire them into chat.py when ready.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── input stubs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

